    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Artist Talk: Dust Archives";
  schema:description """
	This exhibition, supported by Manitoba Opera, will be featured on the Piano Nobile during the run of Scott Joplin’s Treemonisha: A Musical Reimagining, November 21-27.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Here’s your chance to meet the artist, hear about the exhibit, and take a sneak peek at the works!
""";
