    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Conducting Pop-Up";
  schema:description """
	Conductor Jeri Lynne Johnson and the musicians of Scott Joplin's Treemonisha: A Musical Reimagining are ready to make music with you. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Children and adults are encouraged to pick up the baton.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This presentation is a collaboration between Black Pearl Chamber Orchestra, Manitoba Opera, and Volcano. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We acknowledge the support of the Canada Council for the Arts.<span><br/></span>
""";
