<http://www.spektrix.com/manitobaopera/event/24801AHGPCJBMGMVRBNKLDDDHKTKTNBQS> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Roots in Harmony Winter Concert";
  schema:description """
	Manitoba Opera presents an evening of music and community featuring spirituals, gospel and contemporary choral works rooted in Black musical traditions that celebrate what music moves us to do: seek freedom, grow into ourselves, and care for each other. Roots in Harmony, under the direction of Mwansa Mwansa, is joined by acclaimed bass-baritone Marvin Lowe for this spectacular concert.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Mr. Lowe makes his Manitoba Opera debut this season in the Western Canadian premiere of Scott Joplin's Treemonisha: A Musical Reimagining. <span><br/></span>Free to attend. Advance registration is appreciated.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We acknowledge the support of the Canada Council for the Arts.
""";
